Squinch Kubernetes pack
=======================

Icon artwork in `icons/` comes from the Kubernetes community icon set
(https://github.com/kubernetes/community/tree/main/icons), published by the
Kubernetes Authors to standardize Kubernetes architecture diagrams, and
dual-licensed under a choice of Apache-2.0 or CC-BY-4.0. This pack
redistributes under the Apache-2.0 arm; the licence text travels in
LICENSE-ICONS.txt, and this notice carries the attribution:

  Kubernetes community icons — © the Kubernetes Authors.

Three treatments are applied at fetch time, all permitted by the licence:
Inkscape / sodipodi / RDF editor metadata is stripped from each file (it was
more than half the bytes), and CSS `style` attributes are converted to the
equivalent SVG presentation attributes (the upstream files carry all their
paint in `style`, which Squinch's load-time sanitizer does not admit), and
the root `viewBox` is expanded by 8% per side — the artwork is drawn
edge-to-edge upstream, and the margin gives it the same optical breathing
room the other colour packs ship with. Paint and geometry values are moved
verbatim, never altered. Beyond that, icons are
regenerated with `npm run fetch` from a pinned upstream commit and never
hand-edited.

